prehensively debunked by DNA studies. However, its use does have some advantages - it effectively shows up the writer as uninterested in truth, justice and the American (or English) way.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/6054138097708451251'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/6054138097708451251'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html?showComment=1475473050815#c6054138097708451251' title=''/><author><name>RuthTruth</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04147645351533652253</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3017363460293346911' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3017363460293346911' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1465202794"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 2, 2016 at 11:37 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7922171286715448160</id><published>2016-09-30T11:01:40.912-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-30T11:01:40.912-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Another objection to race-based reparations: who i...</title><content type='html'>Another objection to race-based reparations: who is black?  Obama is said to be &amp;quot;black&amp;quot;, but he&amp;#39;s half white.  Should he half-pay and half-receive reparations, thus on balance paying and receiving nothing?  And the formal apology demanded: should Obama formally apologize to himself on behalf of himself?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;How about Tiger Woods?  He might need an accountant to figure out what portion of himself owes money and what portion is the beneficiary of reparations.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/7922171286715448160'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/7922171286715448160'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html?showComment=1475254900912#c7922171286715448160' title=''/><author><name>JdL</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00630104950043758864</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3017363460293346911' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3017363460293346911' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1634901166"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 30, 2016 at 11:01 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3507698995333429050</id><published>2016-09-30T04:47:20.043-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-30T04:47:20.043-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The war on drugs, was and always has been a politi...</title><content type='html'>The war on drugs, was and always has been a political tool. In fact the war on drugs is the tree trunk of evil branching out in so many different directions. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017