ld it be equal to half of the US population today, say 165 million people? Why would that number of lifetimes be any different than slaves in the fields making a profit for the plantation owner. In all fairness there were many black slave owners, a known fact that is taboo to talk about. Being it&amp;#39;s taboo to have an open and honest discussion on this topic, then the topic has nothing whatsoever to do with justice in any form, but to propagandize a scam to steal people&amp;#39;s wages, part of their lives. A textbook example of an oxymoron.  </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/9177862529087053450'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/9177862529087053450'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html?showComment=1475231811701#c9177862529087053450' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3017363460293346911' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3017363460293346911' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1788330330"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 30, 2016 at 4:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1779840870332027792</id><published>2016-09-29T16:55:41.053-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-29T16:55:41.053-06:00</updated><title type='text'>forcing those who never owned slaves to pay those ...</title><content type='html'>forcing those who never owned slaves to pay those who never were slaves is not only tyrannical, it is, itself, racist.  i suppose this is lost on the &amp;#39;enlightened ones&amp;#39; spewing such racist tripe.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/1779840870332027792'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3017363460293346911/comments/default/1779840870332027792'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html?showComment=1475189741053#c1779840870332027792' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2016/09/rather-than-indulging-reparations.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3017363460293346911' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3017363460293346911' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-943604346"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 29, 2016 at 4:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8353500400307937185</id><published>2016-09-29T13:13:29.735-06:00</published><updated>2016-09-29T13:13:29.735-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Of note is that the NAACP was in 1909 founded, not...</title><content type='html'>Of note is that the NAACP was in 1909 founded, not by black Americans, but by a clutch of Khazarians and one mulatto black, Du Bois. The NAACP was then headed for the next 66 years by Khazarians (Look it up).&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;This Khazarian founded and funded NAACP com